# Juman Master Roadmap - living canvas

Project position is tracked in **two places that must stay identical**:

1. Markdown: `docs/JUMAN_MASTER_ROADMAP.md`
2. Canvas: `C:\Users\moham\.cursor\projects\c-Users-moham-Desktop-juman\canvases\juman-master-roadmap.canvas.tsx`

## When to update (required)

Update **both** files at the end of any turn that:

- Completes an approved phase or sub-phase
- Changes overall % / track % / YOU ARE HERE / next step
- Adds a locked decision or append-only history entry
- The user asks to update the roadmap or canvas

Do **not** wait for the user to remind you. Prefer a short canvas refresh over leaving stale position data.

## What to bump

- `Last updated` / canvas `META.lastUpdated`
- Overall progress and track percentages (`TRACKS`, UsageBars, BarChart)
- YOU ARE HERE callout (`META.currentPhase`, `currentStep`, `nextStep`)
- Todo statuses (DS phases, backend residuals)
- Append completed-work + decision rows - **never erase** past history

